                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4359: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-13T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 13, 1922—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>121. Your 213 May 11, 3 P.M.</p>
                <p>The Department approves your course in avoiding any intervention in the military
                    struggle between the two factions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
